data/retention_purge.lock

# ── r132 — THE BOOTSTRAP TEMPLATE IS TRACKED AGAIN ──────────────────────────
# 🔴 THE `!bootstrap.example.sh` AT THE TOP OF THIS FILE HAS NOT WORKED SINCE
# THE FILE WAS SORTED. gitignore is LAST MATCH WINS, and the sort floated the
# `!` line above `bootstrap*.sh`, so the rule it was meant to override re-ignored
# it — the template silently left the repo and a fresh box had nothing to copy.
# Re-included HERE, after every pattern that could match it. Keep it last.
# ⚠️ ONLY THE .example IS INCLUDED; every other bootstrap*.sh holds real secrets.
!bootstrap.example.sh
# Claude Code's per-checkout overrides — machine-local by design (the shared,
# committed permissions are .claude/settings.json).
.claude/settings.local.json
# r168 - the emergency watchdog: the bot heartbeat and the watchdog episode state, runtime only
data/BOT_HEARTBEAT
data/emergency_watchdog.json
data/emergency_watchdog.json.tmp
cap_counterfactual.jsonl
